{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>He pursues</b> — that he hastens to do it; righteousness, as if he pursues it. <b>He finds life</b> — that his days are lengthened. <b>He finds</b> his need from El, his salvation." "<b>And honor</b> — that people honor him, or HaShem gives him honor, meaning wealth, for it is very heavy."], :book :proverbs, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Ibn Ezra on Proverbs -- Daat" "http://www.daat.ac.il/he-il/tanach/parshanut_hamikra/full-text/eben-ezra/mishley/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:24:01.262724006Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}